  <event id="79">
      <start>13:00</start>
      <duration>00:45</duration>
      <room>H.1301</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Farsight 2: Video conferencing made easy</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://farsight.freedesktop.org/&#34;&gt;Farsight 2&lt;/a&gt; is a next-generation &lt;a href=&#34;http://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/&#34;&gt;GStreamer&lt;/a&gt; based videoconferencing framework, used in the &lt;a href=&#34;http://telepathy.freedesktop.org/&#34;&gt;Telepathy framework&lt;/a&gt;, Nokia Internet tablets, etc. It supports advanced features multi-party conferencing, lip-sync, etc.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Olivier will present a bit of the history of farsight, what it does, and show a nice cool demo and a three slide VoIP program.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="791">Olivier Crête</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>